  "goodToKnow": "Wählerisch means choosy or picky: wählerisch beim Essen, in der Partnerwahl, bei Jobs. It can be neutral or slightly critical. In southern Germany and Austria, heikel is a common synonym for picky eaters. From wählen (to choose, vote, dial). The proverb Wer die Wahl hat, hat die Qual (choice is agony) suits wählerische people."
